  "尚无还原点。成功恢复备份后，会自动保留恢复前的数据。": "No restore point yet. A successful restore automatically retains the previous data.",
  "还原点记录": "Restore point records",
  "{0} 条检测记录": "{0} inspection records",
  "创建时间": "Created at",
  "旧版未记录": "Not recorded in legacy version",
  "创建人": "Created by",
