  "本机还原点": "Local restore point",
  "{0} 的本机还原点": "Local restore point from {0}",
  "示例数据": "Example data",
  "当前有 {0} 条示例 / 模拟记录。": "Currently {0} example / simulated records.",
  "示例用于体验流程。清理时将删除带有示例标记的检测记录，包括在工位生成的模拟记录。": "Examples demonstrate the workflow. Cleanup deletes all marked example records, including simulations generated at stations.",
  "添加一组示例": "Add example set",
  "已添加 96 条示例记录": "Added 96 example records",
  "清理所有示例记录？": "Remove all example records?",
  "将删除 {0} 条示例 / 模拟检测记录，包含已归档记录。配方、成员和操作日志会保留。": "This deletes {0} example / simulated records, including archived records. Recipes, members and activity logs are retained.",
  "清理示例": "Remove examples",
  "示例记录已清理": "Example records removed",
  "卸载应用会移除本机账户和数据。需要保留业务数据时，请先保存 JSON 备份，并单独妥善保存账户恢复码。": "Uninstalling removes local accounts and data. Save a business backup first and keep account recovery codes separately.",
  "同一时刻，清楚记录。": "Record each instant clearly.",
  "记录按 UTC 保存，页面按设备本地时区显示。": "Records are saved in UTC and displayed in the device's local time zone.",
  "设备当前时区": "Device time zone",
  "UTC 时间，末尾带 Z 标记": "UTC time with a trailing Z",
  "今天、日期筛选与每日统计使用本地日历边界。设备时区改变后，记录的显示时间和所属日期可能变化，记录代表的时刻保持不变。详情显示该时刻的 UTC 偏移。": "Today, date filters and daily statistics use local calendar boundaries. Changing the device time zone may change displayed times and dates, while each recorded instant stays the same. Details show the UTC offset at that instant.",
  "旧版时间兼容": "Legacy timestamp compatibility",
  "旧版没有时区标记的时间无法反推出原始时区。导入时需要选择来源时间规则并确认预览。固定偏移不会自动切换夏令时。": "Timestamps without a time zone do not reveal the original zone. Choose the source timestamp rules and confirm the import preview. Fixed offsets do not switch for daylight saving.",
  "本机没有需要转换的旧版时间原件。": "No legacy timestamp originals need conversion on this device.",
  "升级时间": "Upgrade time",
  "升级时设备时区": "Device time zone at upgrade",
  "已解释的旧时间": "Interpreted legacy timestamps",
  "{0} 个": "{0} items",
  "升级按当时设备的历史时区规则解释旧时间；夏令时跳过的钟表时间沿用系统校正结果。上方偏移仅表示升级时刻；历史时间可能采用不同的夏令时偏移。原始工作区及旧还原点另行保留在本机，恢复操作不会覆盖这些原件。": "The upgrade interpreted timestamps using the device's historical time zone rules, including system adjustments for skipped clock times. The offset above applies at upgrade time; historical offsets may differ. Original workspace and restore point data are retained separately and are not overwritten by restores.",
  "如来源时区有误，可导出原件，再从数据管理选择该文件并重新解释时间。原件是升级时的快照，恢复前请先保存当前完整备份。相同 ID 的现有日志仍以本机日志为准。": "If the source time zone is wrong, export the original and import it from data management with new timestamp rules. Originals are snapshots from upgrade time; save a current full backup first. Existing local logs take precedence for matching IDs.",
  "导出工作区原件": "Export original workspace",
  "导出旧还原点原件": "Export original legacy restore point",
  "让质量，有迹可循。": "Make quality traceable.",
  "面向产线检测的本机工作区。": "A local workspace for production inspections.",
  "01  开始一次检测": "01 Start an inspection",
  "在工作台选择工位，确认当前配方，启动工位后点击「模拟检测」。检测结果与配方快照会自动保存。目前所有画面与检测均为模拟。": "Choose a station on the dashboard, confirm its recipe, start it and select “Simulated inspection”. Results and recipe snapshots are saved automatically. All images and inspections are currently simulated.",
  "02  处理异常与复核": "02 Review exceptions",
  "从异常待办或检测记录打开详情，查看缺陷与置信度。工程师和管理员可填写复核依据并放行或判退。原始结果保留，每次复核变更写入日志。": "Open details from the exception queue or records. Check the defect and confidence. Engineers and administrators can enter a reason and accept or reject the part. Original results are retained and each review change is logged.",
  "03  配方与换型": "03 Recipes and changeovers",
  "在配方中心新增、编辑或复制配方。换型时选择工位、目标配方并填写原因。新配置只影响后续检测，历史快照保持不变。正在使用的配方不能删除。": "Create, edit or duplicate recipes in the recipe center. For changeovers, choose a station and recipe and enter a reason. New settings affect subsequent inspections only. Historical snapshots are retained. Recipes in use cannot be deleted.",
  "04  管理数据与备份": "04 Manage data and backups",
  "记录支持搜索、日期范围、工位和判定筛选。已处理的记录可归档并恢复。CSV 可用于分析；JSON 可恢复业务数据。账户不随备份迁移，恢复前自动保留一个还原点。": "Search and filter records by dates, stations and results. Archive reviewed records and restore them later. CSV supports analysis; LSB and JSON restore business data. Accounts do not transfer with backups. A restore point is retained automatically before restoration.",
  "05  账户与恢复码": "05 Accounts and recovery codes",
  "首个账户为管理员。管理员可添加成员、设置角色或停用账户。登录连续失败会触发短暂锁定。忘记密码时使用创建账户时保存的恢复码。每次冷启动都需登录。": "The first account is an administrator. Administrators add members, assign roles and disable accounts. Repeated sign-in failures trigger a temporary lock. Use your saved recovery code if you forget your password. Sign in after each cold start.",
  "06  本机数据与隐私": "06 Local data and privacy",
  "账户与检测数据保存在应用的本机数据库中，密码经过加盐派生处理。应用没有云账户和同步服务。业务备份为明文 JSON，请选择合适的保存位置。示例记录始终有标记。": "Accounts and inspection data stay in the local database. Passwords use salted key derivation. There are no cloud accounts or sync services. Business backups are unencrypted; store them securely. Example records are always marked.",
  "正在打开\n本机工作区": "Opening your\nlocal workspace",
  "记录较多时可能需要稍候。准备完成后即可登录。": "Large workspaces may take a moment. Sign in when ready.",
  "LineSight {0} · 离线可用": "LineSight {0} · Available offline",
