  "{0} 次": "{0} inspections",
  "工位对比": "Station comparison",
  "{0} 次检测 · {1} 条待复核": "{0} inspections · {1} pending reviews",
  "原始合格率 = 原始合格数 / 检测数。复核后合格率使用最近一次复核结论；未复核记录沿用原始判定。归档记录不计入统计。": "Original pass rate = original passes / inspections. Pass rate after review uses the latest review result; unreviewed records use the original result. Archived records are excluded.",
  "本机数据恢复": "Local data recovery",
  "保留原件，恢复工作。": "Keep the originals. Restore your work.",
  "工作区暂时无法打开，现有存储仍保留在本机。": "The workspace cannot open right now. Existing storage remains on this device.",
  "请检查本机存储后重试。": "Check local storage and retry.",
  "未完成步骤": "Incomplete step",
  "可以先释放设备存储空间，再重试读取。重试会继续读取原数据库。": "Free some device storage, then retry reading the original database.",
  "重试读取": "Retry reading",
  "使用已有备份恢复": "Recover from an existing backup",
  "先验证本机管理员，再选择 LSB 或 JSON 备份。恢复前会保留原始存储；本机账户保持原有密码和权限。": "Verify a local administrator, then choose an LSB or JSON backup. Original storage is retained before recovery; account passwords and permissions are preserved.",
  "管理员用户名": "Administrator username",
  "使用账户恢复码验证": "Verify with account recovery code",
  "管理员密码": "Administrator password",
  "显示凭据": "Show credentials",
  "隐藏凭据": "Hide credentials",
  "恢复码验证仅用于本次数据恢复，不会重设密码。连续验证失败 5 次会限制尝试 1 分钟。": "Recovery code verification applies to this data recovery only and does not reset the password. Five failed attempts impose a one-minute lock.",
  "验证管理员": "Verify administrator",
  "暂时无法验证管理员": "Administrator verification unavailable",
  "需要可读取且已启用的本机管理员账户才能恢复。请保留应用及其本机数据，检查设备存储后重试；如需进一步排查，可联系设备维护人员。现有备份可以在另一台设备建立工作区后导入。": "Recovery requires a readable, enabled local administrator account. Keep the app and local data, check device storage and retry. Contact your device maintainer if needed. Existing backups can be imported after creating a workspace on another device.",
  "卸载应用或清除应用数据会删除本机账户、记录和保留的原件。": "Uninstalling or clearing app data deletes local accounts, records and retained originals.",
  "从备份恢复工作区": "Recover workspace from backup",
  "退出恢复验证": "Exit recovery verification",
  "选择可用的备份。": "Choose an available backup.",
  "先检查文件，再确认恢复。": "Check the file, then confirm recovery.",
  "已验证管理员": "Verified administrator",
  "验证已过期": "Verification expired",
  "账户与密码": "Accounts and passwords",
  "保留现有本机账户": "Retain existing local accounts",
  "成功恢复时自动保留": "Automatically retained on successful recovery",
  "当前工作区无法完整读取，不能可靠比较新旧内容。恢复以所选备份为准，备份之后的变更和损坏数据不会自动合并。旧还原点与备份回执会转入恢复前原件，可在恢复后导出排查。": "The current workspace cannot be read completely, so changes cannot be compared reliably. Recovery uses the chosen backup; later changes and damaged data are not merged automatically. Old restore points and backup receipts move into the original data archive for later export.",
  "原件保留与新工作区写入会一起完成。空间不足或写入失败时，原数据库保持恢复前的状态。恢复验证离开应用 30 秒后自动锁定。": "Retaining originals and writing the new workspace happen together. On insufficient storage or write failure, the original database retains its previous state. Recovery verification locks after 30 seconds away.",
  "选择恢复备份": "Choose recovery backup",
  "无法解释旧时间，请重新选择。": "Could not interpret legacy timestamps. Select another rule.",
  "异常恢复确认": "Storage recovery confirmation",
  "确认恢复的内容。": "Confirm what to recover.",
  "原始存储将保留，业务数据以此备份为准。": "Original storage is retained; business data comes from this backup.",
  "格式": "Format",
  "{0} 条（含归档）": "{0} records (including archived)",
  "解释旧备份时间": "Interpret legacy backup times",
  "{0} 个时间没有时区。请选择原设备的记录规则。": "{0} timestamps have no time zone. Choose the source device's rules.",
  "固定偏移不会切换夏令时。来源跨夏令时时，请在对应时区设备选择历史规则；重复钟表时间需人工核对。中国标准时间可选 UTC+08:00。": "Fixed offsets do not switch for daylight saving. For seasonal changes, choose historical rules on a device in the source time zone. Repeated clock times need manual checking. China Standard Time: UTC+08:00.",
  "恢复后会怎样": "After recovery",
  "保留本机账户、密码和角色。能读取的外观设置与时间升级原件继续保留；旧还原点、备份回执及其余原始存储进入恢复前原件。无法读取的旧日志不会合并到新工作区。恢复完成后需要重新登录。": "Local accounts, passwords and roles are retained. Readable appearance settings and upgrade originals are retained. Old restore points, backup receipts and other original storage are archived. Unreadable logs are not merged. Sign in again after recovery.",
  "已确认备份内容、时间解释和恢复影响": "I confirm the backup content, timestamp rules and recovery impact",
  "保留原件并恢复": "Keep originals and recover",
  "恢复工作区？": "Recover workspace?",
  "将保留当前原始存储，并使用此备份建立可读取的工作区。备份之后的变更不会自动恢复。": "Original storage will be retained, and this backup will create a readable workspace. Changes made after the backup are not recovered automatically.",
  "恢复工作区": "Recover workspace",
  "恢复过程，有据可查。": "A traceable recovery process.",
  "恢复前原件保留在本机，可单独导出排查。": "Original data is retained locally and can be exported for troubleshooting.",
  "原件包含恢复前的原始业务存储与设置，可能含损坏内容；它不是可以直接恢复的业务备份。导出不包含账户密码和恢复码。卸载或清除应用数据会删除本机保留的原件。": "Originals contain business storage and settings from before recovery, potentially including damaged content. They are not restorable business backups. Exports exclude account passwords and recovery codes. Uninstalling or clearing app data deletes retained originals.",
  "无法读取恢复记录": "Could not read recovery history",
  "请返回重试，或检查本机存储空间。": "Go back and retry, or check available storage.",
  "暂无异常恢复记录": "No storage recovery history",
  "工作区正常打开时，请使用常规备份与恢复。": "Use regular backups and restores when your workspace opens normally.",
  "{0}\n{1} · 恢复 {2} 条记录 · 原件 {3}": "{0}\n{1} · {2} records restored · Originals {3}",
  "准备中…": "Preparing…",
  "保留最初的内容。": "Retain the original content.",
  "导出原件供排查，不会覆盖当前工作区。": "Export originals for troubleshooting without overwriting the current workspace.",
  "恢复时间": "Recovery time",
  "使用的备份": "Backup used",
  "恢复记录数": "Records restored",
  "原始内容大小": "Original content size",
  "恢复编号": "Recovery ID",
  "导出为 LSR 排查文件，保存后会回读校验。文件未加密，包含原始业务内容及设置，不能作为 LSB / JSON 备份导入。分段编码会使文件大于原始内容，导出文件上限为 256 MB。": "Exports an LSR troubleshooting file and verifies it after saving. The file is unencrypted and contains original business data and settings. It cannot be imported as an LSB / JSON backup. Chunk encoding increases file size; the export limit is 256 MB.",
  "导出恢复前原件": "Export originals before recovery",
